{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"TrackingPlans","symbolKind":"module","title":"TrackingPlans","role":"collection"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracking-plan.json"},{"type":"text","text":", and for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tools outside the app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","type":"reference"},{"text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference","type":"reference"},{"text":" names","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", marked "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"type":"text","text":". It writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanTesting"},{"type":"text","text":". The schemas usually come from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" takes every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" in the program and the library’s own events, found at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run time, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" takes a list."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The module is a product of its own that ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Traffluent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" leaves out.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()  \/\/ every @Event in the program, and the library's own","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", ..., \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The plan also writes the schemas of an Iglu registry, which a Snowplow pipeline validates events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"). Version N of an event is SchemaVer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-0"},{"text":". For Iglu Server, a compatible change at the same version is the next addition, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-1"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and on, superseding the earlier ones; a static repository doesn’t supersede, so there the export","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses it, and so it does a breaking change for either kind: raise the event’s version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"],"anchor":"Making-a-plan","title":"Making a plan"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"],"anchor":"Writing-a-plan","title":"Writing a plan"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError"],"anchor":"Exporting-an-Iglu-registry","title":"Exporting an Iglu registry"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"],"anchor":"Checking-a-plan","title":"Checking a plan"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingplanworkflow":{"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","title":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","type":"link"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCheck":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","title":"TrackingPlanCheck","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancheck","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What checking a tracking plan against the committed one found: a match, a committed plan that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is only out of date, or differences that break it."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/schemas":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/schemas","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"schemas","abstract":[{"text":"The plan’s event schemas, ordered by the UTF-8 bytes of their names and then by version.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/schemas","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"schemas","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventSchema","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventSchemaV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventSchema":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventschema","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventSchema"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventSchema"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The shape of an event type: its name, its schema version, its consent category and its stored","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties in declaration order, as a value tooling reads.","type":"text"}],"title":"EventSchema"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/init(schemas:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/init(schemas:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan of the events "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"schemas"},{"type":"text","text":" describe, in any order, or an error naming the first rule"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they break."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"schemas","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventSchemaV"},{"text":"]) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanErrorO"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"init(schemas:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCommand":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancommand","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"TrackingPlanCommand","abstract":[{"text":"An executable that writes a tracking plan: the type marked ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"text":" in a target of the app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package that links the modules declaring its events.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanCommand"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanCommand"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/files(carryingForward:)":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"files","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"carryingForward","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"File","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"File","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","title":"files(carryingForward:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/files(carryingforward:)","abstract":[{"text":"The plan’s files, as ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files"},{"text":" lists them, with each event’s document keeping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties its document in ","type":"text"},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", at the same name and version, has that the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no longer declares: each with its schema there, marked ","type":"text"},{"code":"deprecated: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The documents in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of an event’s earlier versions, below the newest the plan lists, are kept too,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with their examples, byte for byte, and listed in the index.","type":"text"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/IgluExportError":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IgluExportError","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError","title":"IgluExportError","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/igluexporterror","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why a tracking plan couldn’t be written as an Iglu registry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IgluExportError","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanError":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanError"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"TrackingPlanError","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplanerror","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why schemas can’t make a tracking plan."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanError"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/writeigluregistry(to:vendor:registry:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Writes the plan’s events as the schemas of an Iglu registry of the kind "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registry"},{"type":"text","text":" under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vendor"},{"type":"text","text":" into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directory"},{"type":"text","text":", the registry’s root, creating the directories needed."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"writeIgluRegistry","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"URL","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"vendor","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"r